        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p002",
      "text": "His countenance was a true picture of his soul.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p001",
      "replacements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p003",
      "text": "He\ncombined a true judgment with simplicity of spirit, which was the\nreason, I apprehend, of his being called Candide.",
