        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p004",
      "text": "The old servants of\nthe family suspected him to have been the son of the Baron's sister, by\na good, honest gentleman of the neighborhood, whom that young lady would\nnever marry because he had been able to prove only seventy-one\nquarterings, the rest of his genealogical tree having been lost through\nthe injuries of time.",
